---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import Entry from '../components/Entry.astro';
import { papers, repos } from '../data/links';
---

<ContentPage title="Education">
	<div class="entry-list">
		<Entry
			level={2}
			title="Illinois State University"
			meta="Normal, IL · Aug 2021 – May 2025"
			subtitle="B.S. in Computer Science, Minor in Mathematics"
			tags={['Java', 'C', 'C++', 'Python', 'HTML', 'CSS', 'JavaScript', 'PHP']}
		>
			<p>
				<strong>Web development coursework:</strong> completed three semester-long web development projects (IT 326, IT 353
				and IT 391) using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, Vue.js, Java, SQL, NoSQL, Firebase and Figma.
			</p>
			<p class="muted">Languages from my coursework:</p>
		</Entry>
	</div>

	<section class="content-section">
		<h2>Machine learning research</h2>
		<p class="section-intro">Three projects with ISU faculty.</p>
		<div class="entry-list">
			<Entry title="Predicting stress forces in materials" tags={['Graph neural networks (GNNs)']}>
				<p>Used graph neural networks (GNNs) to model stress forces.</p>
			</Entry>
			<Entry
				title="Fake news detection (UPFD)"
				subtitle="IT 299: Independent Honors Study"
				tags={['Graph neural networks (GNNs)', 'Text encoders', 'MLflow', 'Optuna']}
				links={[
					{ label: 'Code', href: repos.upfd },
					{ label: 'Paper', href: papers.upfd },
				]}
			>
				<p>
					Rebuilt a published research model that uses GNNs and text encoders to classify news as factual or non-factual.
					Training and tuning were automated with MLflow and Optuna.
				</p>
			</Entry>
			<Entry
				title="Virtual spider agent"
				subtitle="MAT 268: Undergraduate Research in Mathematics"
				tags={['Reinforcement learning', 'Unity ML-Agents']}
				links={[{ label: 'Poster', href: papers.spiderPoster }]}
			>
				<p>
					Trained a reinforcement learning agent in Unity with ML-Agents to follow a moving target, and presented the results
					at the ISU Research Symposium.
				</p>
			</Entry>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<h2>Leadership &amp; activities</h2>
		<div class="list-card card">
			<ul class="plain-list">
				<li>
					<strong>Game Development Club:</strong> ran meetings and made project-wide decisions for a club of 20+ active members,
					building games in C# and Unity with GitHub.
				</li>
				<li><strong>Association for Computing Machinery (ACM):</strong> gave presentations at club events.</li>
				<li>Kept both commitments going while taking six classes a semester during the final two semesters.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>
</ContentPage>
